# Public API of payment-base that is dead inside this repository but called by a provider/consumer repo
# (stripe, mollie-payment, paypal, one-page-checkout, opalreturns, opalsubscription, oxid-admin-graphql).
# Evidence: the same detector run with the consumers' src/ added as analysed paths does NOT report the member.
# payment-base's own CI cannot see the consumers, so these stay baselined; they are not "dead" for the constellation.
# See "Dead-code gate" in docs/dev_log/20261030/sprints/_engeneering_requirements.md. Ticket: VR-17 DC-5.

